Z||000000||flexableface||11-14-2000||04:37 PM||||i some some ealier posts on using a front sway bar off a fiero and be able to mount it as a rear sway bar. Could someone explain how this is done and how difficult it is to do. thanks, lucas||||reg||1
Z||000001||AL||11-14-2000||08:54 PM||||it's not difficult all you do is jack the car,get under it and put the swaybar under the car,then mark the holes where you will drill on the suspension and the arms,then you have to buy the poly bushings and the bolts,buy the smallest bolt kit.here's a pic of my sway bar. <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=522257&a=3823750&p=24977743">  <P>------------------<BR> ||||reg||1
